title: Preparations for an Assassination Attempt on <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Hitler**</span> Begin
subtitle: Georg Elser, an opponent of the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Nazi**</span> regime, is preparing an assassination attempt on <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Hitler**</span>!
view-if: (nazi_year == 6 and nazi_month >= 4 or nazi_year == 7) and month >= 8 and resistance = 1
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: pro_overthrow += 3; 
tags: event

= Preparations for an Assassination Attempt on <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Hitler**</span> Begin!

Internally, we are discussing whether to support him[? if support_elser = 1: more than before. ?]

- @support_2: Support him even more!
- @support_3: Support his plans.
- @nothing: We will not support these preparations.

@support_2
subtitle: -2 resources
choose-if: resources >= 2 and support_elser = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if resources < 1: Not enough resources. ?][? if support_elser != 1: We did not support him yet. ?]
on-arrival: resources -= 2; support_elser_2 = 1; rfb_militancy += 0.05 if antifa = 1; rb_militancy += 0.02; nazi_suspicion += 2;

We support his plans even more! The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Nazis**</span> are becoming suspicious of our activities. We must remain cautious.

@support_3
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
view-if: support_elser != 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; support_elser = 1; rfb_militancy += 0.05 if antifa = 1; rb_militancy += 0.02; nazi_suspicion += 2;

We support his plans! The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Nazis**</span> are becoming suspicious of our activities. We must remain cautious.

@nothing

[? if support_elser != 1: We will not take part in an assassination attempt. Nevertheless, we will not stop him. ?][? if support_elser == 1: While we support the plan, we will not directly assist in the preparations. We fear that if Elser fails, the consequences for our movement could be severe. ?]